      "guid": "7bpencil.transparentsights",
      "name": "Transparent Sights",
      "slug": "transparent-sights",
      "teaser": "Keep both eyes open",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2cZFxd7dGveu0n7npBmFqMappskwdUz0R6U5gf9g.png",
      "downloads": 3236,
      "favourites_count": 32,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">ABOUT</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/7Bpencil/SPT.TransparentSights/refs/heads/master/previews/eotech.png\" alt=\"\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/7Bpencil/SPT.TransparentSights/refs/heads/master/previews/swampfox.png\" alt=\"\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">FAQ</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>How do I make entire weapon transparent?\n<ul>\n<li>Open F12 menu and enable <code>General/Make entire weapon transparent</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>I dislike transparent housings on optic scopes\n<ul>\n<li>Open F12 menu and enable <code>General/Disable transparency in optics</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>I dislike blur, how can I disable it?\n<ul>\n<li>Open F12 menu and disable <code>General/Blur transparent sights</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>I like blur, how can I make it more blurry?\n<ul>\n<li>Open F12 menu and set <code>Depth of Field/Blur Size</code> to higher value</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>I dislike transparency on some scopes\n<ul>\n<li>Double click on scope inventory icon and switch <code>TRANSP: ON</code> to <code>TRANSP: OFF</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Some scope has beefy mount, can I make it transparent too?\n<ul>\n<li>Double click on scope inventory icon and switch <code>TRANSP: ON</code> to <code>TRANSP. ON + MOUNT</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n",
